on.","citation_ids":["cite.long.record-257bm-c15"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-c15"],"id":"long.record-257bm-c15","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.83 (A sufficient lower bound for the integer remainder)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.83, p. 68, label record:257bm-c15","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*$$\n\\forall\\ \\text{skipped rank }n\\ge3,\\quad B(2n) < \\mathrm{rem}(n),\n$$\na sufficient condition for the nonnegativity condition above. Indeed, a negative margin at an actual skip would force $1\\le\\mathrm{rem}(n)\\le B(2n)$, contradicting this bound. This proves the implication, not a converse or strict separation of the conditions.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.record-257bm-c15","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.record-257bm-c15","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c15%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfGreedySkippedFullShellNonnegative%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c15%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfGreedySkippedFullShellNonnegative%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.HalfGreedySkippedFullShellNonnegative"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.record-257bm-c15","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c15%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_seam_escape_forces_remainder_band%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","re